    cross_pre   tanh(g)=-0.00012  ||W||= 15.8597  ||b||= 1.4019   EFFECTIVE |tanh(g)|*||W|| = 0.00191
    cross_post  tanh(g)=-0.00142  ||W||= 15.7783  ||b||= 1.3316   EFFECTIVE |tanh(g)|*||W|| = 0.02244
